sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor NV as Thu ngan
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant GW as Gateway
    participant SS as sales-service
    participant PG as PostgreSQL
    participant OB as OutboxRelay
    participant KF as Kafka
    participant INV as inventory-service
    participant FIN as finance-service

    Note over NV,FIN: Luong dat don thanh cong (POS)

    NV->>FE: Mo ca
    FE->>GW: POST /pos-sessions
    GW->>SS: openPosSession
    SS->>PG: pos_session OPEN

    NV->>FE: Chon SP, thanh toan
    FE->>GW: POST /orders (Idempotency-Key)
    GW->>SS: submitSale
    SS->>SS: RBAC + PromotionEngine
    SS->>PG: Kiem ton BOM, INSERT order_created
    SS-->>FE: 201 Created

    FE->>GW: POST /orders/{id}/approve
    GW->>SS: approveSale
    SS->>PG: order_approved + tru ton kho
    SS->>PG: outbox sale-approved
    opt CRM / dine_in
        SS->>PG: loyalty / kitchen_ticket
    end
    SS-->>FE: 200 OK

    OB->>PG: poll outbox
    OB->>KF: sale-approved
    KF->>INV: tru ton idempotent

    NV->>FE: Xac nhan thanh toan
    FE->>GW: POST /mark-payment-done
    GW->>SS: markPaymentDone
    SS->>PG: payment_done + outbox payment-captured
    SS-->>FE: 200 OK
    FE-->>NV: Payment captured

    OB->>KF: payment-captured
    KF->>FIN: issueInvoice
